 "notes": [
  "No Objective. Starting cards as posted under START (6): Podrace Prep, Anakin's Podracer ('Anikan's Racer'), Strike Planning, Boonta Eve Podrace, Tatooine: Podrace Arena and Tatooine: Slave Quarters; the strategy drops Shmi and Threepio to the Quarters on turn 1, so Slave Quarters is the starting location and Strike Planning the free Effect deployed by Podrace Prep. All count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 6 August 2001, before Coruscant, with no Coruscant-set cards, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Section headers (START, LOCATIONS, CHARACTERS, WEAPONS, INTERRUPTS, EFFECTS, 'MISC PURP CARD(1)') are not cards; the 'purple card' is the Epic Event I Did It!.",
  "Posted 'Master Luke Skywalker' dested Master Luke; 'Luke With Saber' Luke With Lightsaber; 'Obi WK Padawan' Obi-Wan Kenobi, Padawan Learner; 'chardra fan' Chadra-Fan (the description: 'non-unique aliens (chardra fans)'); 'Twass Khaa' Tawss Khaa; 'Shimi' Shmi Skywalker; 'Qui-Gon' Qui-Gon Jinn; 'Obi's saber' Obi-Wan's Lightsaber.",
  "Posted 'T Mos Espa', 'T City Outskirts', 'T Podracer Bay' dested the Tatooine sites; 'T JP' the Light Special Edition site Tatooine: Jabba's Palace; 'JP AC' Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber.",
  "Posted 'Nar Shadda' dested Nar Shaddaa Wind Chimes; 'You Will Take me TJN' You Will Take Me To Jabba Now; 'Aim High' the Light Endor Effect Aim High (posted under Effects, inside the 60)."
